 -making Proposal\, MaineCare Benefits Manual\, Chapter II\, Section 20\, H
 ome and Community Based Services for Adults with Other Related Conditions
DESCRIPTION:Maine.gov\nAgencies\n|\nOnline Services\n|\nHelp\n|\nSearch Ma
 ine.gov\nDHHS\n→\nOffice of MaineCare Services (OMS)\n→\nProvider Reso
 urces\n→\n	 \n			Public Comment Deadline Extended: Agency Rule-making Pr
 oposal\, MaineCare Benefits Manual\, Chapter II\, Section 20\, Home and Co
 mmunity Based Services for Adults with Other Related Conditions\nPublic Co
 mment Deadline Extended: Agency Rule-making Proposal\, MaineCare Benefits 
 Manual\, Chapter II\, Section 20\, Home and Community Based Services for A
 dults with Other Related Conditions\nSep 25\, 2026\nOn August 26\, 2026\, 
 the Department\nprovided notice\nof a proposed rulemaking for 10-144 C.M.R
 . Ch. 101\, MaineCare Benefits Manual (MBM) Ch. II\, Sec. 20\, Home and Co
 mmunity Based Services for Adults with Other Related Conditions with a\nco
 mment deadline\nof September 25\, 2026. Due to an error with the email add
 ress provided for submitting public comments\, the Department is\nextendin
 g the public comment period\nby 10 days to ensure all interested parties h
 ave an opportunity to submit comments.\nThe Department will now accept com
 ments through Monday\, October 5\, 2026\, at 11:59 PM\, EST.\nPlease submi
 t comments to the following email address:\nmegan.brooks@maine.gov\n.\nTha
 nk you for your interest and participation in the public comment process.\
