 ices\nWorkplace Safety\nLabor Laws\nLabor Statistics\nWorkforce Developmen
 t\nMaine Department of Labor announces October workplace safety and labor 
 law training schedule\nSeptember 24\, 2026\nFor Immediate Release: Thursda
 y\, Sept. 24\, 2026\nMedia Contact: Autumn Mahoney\, Communications Specia
 list\nmedia.dol@maine.gov\nAUGUSTA - The Maine Department of Labor offers 
 free workplace safety and labor law training to help employers\, managers\
 , supervisors\, human resources professionals and others understand workpl
 ace safety requirements and Maine labor laws. The Department has announced
  its schedule of October classes\, with trainings offered through SafetyWo
 rks! and the Bureau of Labor Standards.\nRegistration is required\, and sp
 ace may be limited.\nView the October schedule and register for a class\n.
 \nUnless otherwise noted\, classes are held at the SafetyWorks! Training I
 nstitute at the Maine Department of Labor\, 45 Commerce Drive in Augusta.\
 nOctober Class Schedule\nFire Extinguisher/Emergency Action Plans/Workplac
 e Violence \nThursday\, Oct. 1\, 8:30 a.m. to 3:30 p.m.\nSafetyWorks! Trai
